WEBVTT

01:35.850 --> 01:38.240
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.520 --> 01:41.350
[Episode 7]

01:42.000 --> 01:43.120
I'm so happy!

01:43.200 --> 01:43.560
How...

01:43.560 --> 01:43.960
How...

01:44.400 --> 01:45.560
How did you convince your dad?

01:45.560 --> 01:47.070
With Shan's help, of course!

01:47.070 --> 01:49.110
Shan not only got me a cello instructor,

01:49.110 --> 01:50.400
but also persuaded my dad.

01:50.400 --> 01:51.920
How very nice of him.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.560
Based on your account of him,

01:53.560 --> 01:54.759
Shan is indeed the best

01:54.759 --> 01:56.490
older friend one could ask for.

01:56.920 --> 01:57.640
You must improve

01:57.640 --> 01:59.400
your academic grades during this period.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.640
Or you might miss out on your dream school

02:00.640 --> 02:01.640
due to low scores.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.040
That'll let Shan down.

02:03.150 --> 02:05.350
I checked the cutoff score
for Hailan University.

02:05.350 --> 02:06.480
It is pretty high.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.790
I'm counting on you to improve

02:07.790 --> 02:09.590
my grades on academic subjects.

02:12.000 --> 02:12.870
Me?

02:16.490 --> 02:19.360
Don't you need to practice the cello
at Shan's place?

02:19.360 --> 02:20.240
I think...

02:21.470 --> 02:22.910
during your cello practice there,

02:22.910 --> 02:24.370
you can have him tutor you.

02:24.630 --> 02:26.680
But it's been many years
since Shan took the college entrance exam.

02:26.680 --> 02:28.940
He must've forgotten everything by now.

02:31.030 --> 02:31.630
I guess so.

02:34.470 --> 02:36.430
Then what about your best friend

02:36.430 --> 02:37.360
Luo Ningzi?

02:37.470 --> 02:38.630
Why not turn to her?

02:41.840 --> 02:43.190
Ning could be helpful.

02:44.800 --> 02:46.460
I can really ask Ning for help!

02:46.470 --> 02:47.870
How did that slip my mind?

02:52.120 --> 02:52.980
But as I recall,

02:53.030 --> 02:54.800
she lives pretty far away from your home.

02:54.800 --> 02:55.630
Won't that cause inconvenience?

02:55.630 --> 02:56.280
It won't be a problem.

02:56.280 --> 02:57.740
She can tutor me at school.

03:04.470 --> 03:04.910
No.

03:07.240 --> 03:07.870
Look,

03:09.310 --> 03:12.080
it'll be late by the time you get home
after the tutoring.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.680
Uncle Dong will get worried.

03:13.870 --> 03:14.840
So, you should

03:15.430 --> 03:16.690
still be tutored by me.

03:19.470 --> 03:21.150
First, you said no to helping me.

03:21.150 --> 03:22.910
Then, you offered to tutor me.

03:23.910 --> 03:25.630
What exactly is your decision?

03:25.630 --> 03:27.840
Will you... accept my help or not?

03:27.910 --> 03:29.000
Fine, fine, fine.

03:29.150 --> 03:30.360
Please be my tutor,

03:30.360 --> 03:31.590
my best friend.

03:32.800 --> 03:35.260
You finally realize
who your best friend is.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.170
Stop laughing.

03:40.190 --> 03:40.840
I'm not laughing.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.840
Stop it now!

03:42.190 --> 03:44.240
Knock it off, or I will...

03:44.910 --> 03:45.400
Yi Lan!

03:46.560 --> 03:47.240
Stay back!

03:48.470 --> 03:49.150
Hurry up.

03:49.150 --> 03:50.310
I've been waiting forever.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.750
My dream is to marry my idol.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.210
A seven!

03:52.520 --> 03:53.780
I've got this! My turn!

03:54.680 --> 03:55.210
An eight.

03:55.910 --> 03:58.430
I wish I could be a traveling cellist.

03:58.750 --> 03:59.750
And my wish...

03:59.750 --> 04:01.280
is very simple.

04:02.030 --> 04:06.280
All I want is to be with the person I love
for ever and ever.

04:06.960 --> 04:08.840
"For ever and ever," huh?

04:09.960 --> 04:12.190
Ning, what's your wish?

04:13.590 --> 04:16.190
To be the principal cellist
in a top orchestra.

04:18.870 --> 04:19.560
A flush.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.480
You'll pass, right?

04:20.480 --> 04:20.940
A joker.

04:20.950 --> 04:21.829
Still pass, huh?

04:21.829 --> 04:22.360
A bomb.

04:22.920 --> 04:23.380
All out.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.490
How could we let him win?

04:27.070 --> 04:29.070
-Just admit defeat.
-We lost again.

04:29.470 --> 04:31.000
Where are the paper strips?

04:31.480 --> 04:32.580
There are many on your faces.

04:32.580 --> 04:34.180
Change the punishment then.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.290
Your face...

04:43.310 --> 04:44.240
already has many strips stuck on.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.480
I can only flick your forehead.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.210
Do be gentle.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.580
Luo Ningzi.

05:01.560 --> 05:02.720
Dad, I'm home!

05:03.000 --> 05:03.800
You're back, Lan.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.660
Wash your hands. Dinner's ready.

05:05.800 --> 05:06.240
I'm serving

05:06.240 --> 05:07.840
your favorite dishes today.

05:07.870 --> 05:09.310
Dad, aren't you just amazing?

05:09.310 --> 05:11.510
You're really the best dad in the world.

05:11.750 --> 05:12.870
What got into you today?

05:12.870 --> 05:14.130
You're being so sweet.

05:15.190 --> 05:15.630
Dad.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.920
I'm all grown up now.

05:18.360 --> 05:19.680
If you have anything to say to me,

05:19.680 --> 05:20.680
just be frank and speak up.

05:20.680 --> 05:21.680
I'll understand.

05:22.120 --> 05:23.780
Anyway, no matter what you do,

05:23.870 --> 05:25.070
I know you love me.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.560
Seems like my daughter
has really grown up.

05:29.830 --> 05:31.430
Lecturing your own dad, huh?

05:34.090 --> 05:35.730
[Class 9, Grade 12]

05:42.360 --> 05:42.870
Yi Lan.

05:55.800 --> 05:56.560
Well...

05:57.000 --> 05:59.130
I'm Chen Zhihan from Class 1, Grade 12.

05:59.360 --> 06:01.020
It's okay if you don't know me.

06:01.070 --> 06:01.930
This is for you.

06:02.870 --> 06:03.560
For me?

06:04.430 --> 06:05.120
Thank you.

06:08.070 --> 06:08.680
Well,

06:09.120 --> 06:10.850
are you close with Tong Xiaole?

06:11.750 --> 06:12.480
Yes.

06:15.120 --> 06:17.070
Please pass this letter on to him.

06:22.800 --> 06:23.560
I got it.

06:24.870 --> 06:25.560
Thank you.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.070
I only prepared one cup today.

06:27.070 --> 06:28.870
But I'll buy you yours next time.

06:29.000 --> 06:29.360
Do deliver it.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.420
It's in good hands.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.000
Who is she?

06:35.560 --> 06:36.560
A fan of Xiaole's.

06:37.870 --> 06:40.920
She seems... to be a good match for him.

06:45.000 --> 06:45.800
Dear friends,

06:46.630 --> 06:48.200
I'll soon be off for specialized training.

06:48.200 --> 06:50.200
You might not get to see me at school.

06:51.130 --> 06:52.390
Don't miss me too much!

06:53.680 --> 06:56.610
Zhao Zhenghao,
are you going to study abroad as well?

06:56.680 --> 06:57.680
Abroad? No.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.600
Domestic universities
are obviously better.

07:03.680 --> 07:04.360
Luo Ningzi!

07:04.560 --> 07:06.020
When are you going abroad?

07:06.190 --> 07:07.390
I'm still preparing.

07:07.580 --> 07:08.000
What?

07:08.780 --> 07:10.800
She said she was still preparing.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.890
Since everyone's around,

07:14.890 --> 07:16.240
how about a gathering this weekend?

07:16.240 --> 07:17.700
I have an important issue.

07:19.000 --> 07:19.510
Sure.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.480
Eyes on me!

07:34.000 --> 07:34.920
Look at her.

07:34.920 --> 07:35.580
Eyes on her.

07:35.870 --> 07:36.680
Okay, okay.

07:37.000 --> 07:38.310
You are gathered here today

07:38.310 --> 07:39.510
to help me buy a ticket

07:39.630 --> 07:41.040
to my idol's concert.

07:42.240 --> 07:42.870
Now,

07:43.190 --> 07:44.590
the most important thing

07:44.680 --> 07:46.340
is to test the internet speed.

07:46.630 --> 07:47.480
Get your phones out.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.210
Have a check.

07:48.240 --> 07:48.870
Clear all

07:48.870 --> 07:49.870
background apps.

07:50.430 --> 07:51.630
Nice internet speed.

07:51.920 --> 07:52.450
Cleared.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.360
Cleared.

07:53.680 --> 07:54.190
Good.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.240
Then,

07:55.240 --> 07:57.110
when I count down from ten,

07:57.240 --> 07:59.000
you will open this page

08:00.190 --> 08:01.360
and tap the button like crazy

08:01.360 --> 08:03.000
as the tickets are available for purchase.

08:03.000 --> 08:03.870
Click non-stop.

08:03.870 --> 08:05.630
I thought it was an important matter
in life.

08:05.630 --> 08:06.680
As it turns out, you're just

08:06.680 --> 08:08.240
wasting your life on trifles.

08:08.240 --> 08:09.170
What do you know?

08:09.560 --> 08:11.240
Your idol's not even as handsome as I am.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.560
-Mengmeng, why don't you...
-Zhao Zhenghao!

08:12.560 --> 08:14.430
How dare you speak ill of my idol!

08:14.430 --> 08:15.690
Sorry. I was wrong.

08:15.800 --> 08:16.630
Qiao Mengmeng,

08:16.630 --> 08:17.800
it'll be time soon.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.240
Don't blame us

08:18.240 --> 08:19.640
if you can't get a ticket.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.650
You're off the hook for now!

08:23.800 --> 08:25.860
Alright. Open the page.

08:26.000 --> 08:26.550
Opened.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.260
The countdown starts.

08:30.000 --> 08:30.750
Five.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.390
Four.

08:33.200 --> 08:34.200
-Three.
-Three.

08:34.750 --> 08:35.440
-Two.
-Two.

08:36.120 --> 08:36.669
-One.
-One.

08:36.669 --> 08:37.360
Click it!

08:41.440 --> 08:43.039
Has anyone secured a ticket?

08:45.840 --> 08:47.300
How is that even possible?

08:47.440 --> 08:48.200
The page's not responding.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.390
I'm still trying.

08:55.320 --> 08:55.960
It's frozen.

08:55.960 --> 08:57.020
The checkout page!

08:57.080 --> 08:58.510
I'll pay for it with your money.

08:58.510 --> 08:59.510
It's processing.

09:01.510 --> 09:02.200
Great.

09:05.630 --> 09:06.790
Why is it so slow?

09:07.200 --> 09:08.400
Is the reception bad?

09:08.440 --> 09:09.640
Try it on the balcony.

09:11.080 --> 09:12.600
Is it worth this much trouble?

09:12.600 --> 09:13.630
My goodness.

09:15.630 --> 09:17.200
He's really not handsome.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.300
Mengmeng, did you get the ticket?

09:26.440 --> 09:27.240
What's wrong?

09:27.320 --> 09:28.910
Please don't cry.

09:28.910 --> 09:30.320
-Mengmeng.
-There, there.

09:30.320 --> 09:32.320
We'll figure something out for you.

09:32.550 --> 09:33.320
All is fine.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.720
There will be a solution.

09:34.790 --> 09:35.510
Don't cry.

09:36.420 --> 09:38.670
-This is not your idol's only concert.
-You're really crying?

09:38.670 --> 09:39.980
Your idol will hold another concert.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.740
You can go to that one.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.720
Do you know any other way

09:45.720 --> 09:46.910
to get a ticket?

09:49.400 --> 09:50.440
How about we buy from a scalper?

09:50.440 --> 09:51.360
Yes, a scalper!

09:51.720 --> 09:52.080
Right!

09:52.080 --> 09:53.200
I happen to have a contact,

09:53.200 --> 09:54.320
but he requires face-to-face transaction.

09:54.320 --> 09:54.720
That's okay.

09:54.720 --> 09:56.150
I'll pay for you first, alright?

09:56.150 --> 09:56.840
Let me see.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.790
Scalped tickets are expensive.

09:59.790 --> 10:01.080
Why should we buy any?

10:01.320 --> 10:02.780
It's okay. I'll cover you.

10:08.320 --> 10:11.750
You guys are my best friends!

10:13.910 --> 10:15.000
There, there.

10:20.910 --> 10:22.320
I have arrived.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.080
Regardless of any opinion,

10:24.200 --> 10:26.440
Yu is always the champion!

10:26.670 --> 10:29.060
Regardless of any opinion,

10:29.200 --> 10:31.670
Yu is always the champion!

10:32.320 --> 10:33.000
Miss!

10:34.550 --> 10:35.320
Did you ask for a ticket?

10:35.320 --> 10:35.720
Yes.

10:37.410 --> 10:38.440
It was hard to snag such a ticket.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.120
Thank you.

10:39.200 --> 10:39.720
The concert's about to start.

10:39.720 --> 10:40.390
Get in the venue now.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.200
Sure. Thanks!

10:41.320 --> 10:43.030
Regardless of any opinion,

10:43.120 --> 10:45.440
Yu is always the champion!

10:53.790 --> 10:54.910
Did you deliberately cross my answers?

10:54.910 --> 10:57.040
How could I have made so many mistakes?

10:58.150 --> 11:00.080
This angle is 45 degrees.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.320
Look carefully.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.840
Why are math problems so difficult?

11:07.150 --> 11:09.200
Why is my brain so slow?

11:10.360 --> 11:11.360
Why hit your head?

11:11.440 --> 11:13.770
What if you really knock yourself stupid?

11:18.080 --> 11:18.600
Hello?

11:19.670 --> 11:20.720
Okay, wait a moment.

11:20.720 --> 11:21.780
I‘ll be right down.

11:22.150 --> 11:23.750
I'm going to get the takeout.

11:23.960 --> 11:24.960
Stop hitting your head.

11:24.960 --> 11:26.420
It might take a toll on you.

12:01.270 --> 12:02.200
Why set an alarm

12:02.220 --> 12:03.280
in broad daylight?

12:38.080 --> 12:39.410
What are you looking at?

12:40.720 --> 12:42.920
You folded my wishes into paper cranes?

12:44.240 --> 12:45.870
Who says they are yours?

12:47.790 --> 12:49.270
Not mine?

12:50.080 --> 12:51.680
Then you must've imitated me

12:52.320 --> 12:54.180
and written your wishes on paper.

12:54.910 --> 12:55.630
However...

12:55.790 --> 12:58.670
paper cranes are usually girl stuff.

13:00.720 --> 13:03.030
Do you...

13:03.030 --> 13:04.430
have a crush on some girl?

13:06.510 --> 13:07.080
Who is she?

13:07.080 --> 13:07.720
Tell me!

13:08.600 --> 13:09.270
Cut it out.

13:09.910 --> 13:11.670
Some things are better said in person.

13:11.670 --> 13:12.790
Why write a letter?

13:13.440 --> 13:15.080
Girls always find it embarrassing

13:15.080 --> 13:16.810
to confess their love for boys.

13:18.510 --> 13:19.240
That's true.

13:21.910 --> 13:22.750
Well...

13:24.510 --> 13:26.170
When did this affection grow?

13:27.790 --> 13:29.590
Read the letter and you'll know.

13:36.200 --> 13:37.960
If I determine it to be badly written,

13:37.960 --> 13:39.760
I may have a negative impression

13:40.200 --> 13:41.440
of this girl.

13:41.840 --> 13:43.570
She wrote it with all her heart.

13:43.790 --> 13:45.320
You should at least read it.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.600
Fine.

13:48.200 --> 13:48.910
Be quick.

13:54.910 --> 13:56.080
I hope you won't regret it.

13:56.080 --> 13:56.840
Regret what?

14:01.610 --> 14:03.560
[Chen Zhihan]

14:04.030 --> 14:04.840
Chen Zhihan?

14:05.510 --> 14:06.870
She seemed sincere to me.

14:06.870 --> 14:08.450
Why not consider giving her a chance?

14:08.450 --> 14:09.360
No way.

14:19.200 --> 14:20.320
The food's here?

14:25.510 --> 14:27.510
Leave it there. I'll pack it myself.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.720
I need that pen for later.

14:31.790 --> 14:32.790
It's not done yet.

14:33.510 --> 14:35.240
I have yet to finish that paper.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.250
What's with you?

14:36.720 --> 14:38.080
The alarm just went off, right?

14:38.080 --> 14:39.210
It's time for my nap.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.440
Are you angry?

14:43.580 --> 14:44.710
Why would I be angry?

14:45.080 --> 14:46.670
Just say no to her if you don't like her.

14:46.670 --> 14:48.320
What does this have to do with me?

14:48.320 --> 14:49.670
I only delivered her letter to you.

14:49.670 --> 14:50.360
Leave!

14:50.550 --> 14:51.840
I did nothing but give you her letter!

14:51.840 --> 14:54.970
-You promised to explain that paper to me!
-I need my nap!

14:58.550 --> 14:59.080
Let go.

14:59.200 --> 15:01.080
Why are you so moody?

15:01.080 --> 15:02.320
We had a deal!

15:02.320 --> 15:04.910
Three, two, one.

15:06.200 --> 15:07.320
-I'm not going anywhere!
-Leave!

15:07.320 --> 15:08.150
I insist on staying here!

15:08.150 --> 15:08.840
Let go now!

15:08.840 --> 15:09.500
The food...

15:09.790 --> 15:11.200
I haven't eaten it yet!

15:11.550 --> 15:12.350
Just a second!

15:12.720 --> 15:14.200
Let go of me!

15:14.200 --> 15:15.200
Wait, wait, wait!

15:15.200 --> 15:15.960
Wait!

15:16.120 --> 15:17.670
I just got a message.

15:21.910 --> 15:23.380
[Yi Lan, the concert ticket is fake]

15:25.720 --> 15:26.440
Mengmeng!

15:26.670 --> 15:27.630
Here I come.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.440
How is it a fake ticket?

15:29.440 --> 15:30.500
Maybe try it again?

15:31.760 --> 15:32.790
I had it scanned.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.600
Nothing came up.

15:34.910 --> 15:36.510
The staff wouldn't let me in.

15:36.830 --> 15:38.960
Look, I'll go ask about this ticket.

15:38.960 --> 15:40.090
You girls wait here.

15:40.360 --> 15:40.840
Okay.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.270
Listen!

15:49.390 --> 15:50.390
The concert has begun.

15:50.390 --> 15:51.320
It's actually nice to sit here

15:51.320 --> 15:52.650
and hear your idol sing.

15:53.640 --> 15:57.850
♪ Watching your profile draw near,
I smile like a fool ♪

15:54.910 --> 15:56.510
This is his debut song.

15:57.510 --> 15:59.550
When my parents were fighting
and getting divorced,

15:58.310 --> 16:02.460
♪ Every word you said, like a melody,
sprouts in my heart ♪

15:59.790 --> 16:02.390
listening to his songs was the only way
I could sleep.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.600
Didn't I already show it to you?

16:02.980 --> 16:06.650
♪ The sparks between us
burn bright within the notes ♪

16:03.600 --> 16:04.840
So what was the big deal?

16:04.840 --> 16:05.970
It was just a dinner.

16:06.440 --> 16:08.030
It was not like...

16:07.150 --> 16:08.950
♪ I look forward ♪

16:08.030 --> 16:10.080
I had it with her alone.

16:08.980 --> 16:10.810
♪ To hearing your answer ♪

16:10.080 --> 16:11.440
Lots of people were there as well.

16:11.420 --> 16:13.850
♪ My heart won't stop its racing beat ♪

16:11.910 --> 16:13.510
But you two give off a different vibe.

16:13.510 --> 16:14.670
What vibe?

16:13.880 --> 16:16.140
♪ The sweetness when our eyes meet ♪

16:15.080 --> 16:16.100
We've been married for years!

16:16.100 --> 16:16.790
Look,

16:16.600 --> 16:20.710
♪ Each time we meet,
it's as if the dream goes on ♪

16:16.790 --> 16:17.440
you wouldn't let me eat

16:17.440 --> 16:17.910
with anyone.

16:17.910 --> 16:18.440
What...

16:18.440 --> 16:19.390
What do you want from me?

16:19.390 --> 16:20.760
You lack a sense of boundaries...

16:20.760 --> 16:22.900
♪ How I wish to tell you ♪

16:21.910 --> 16:23.550
Come to think of it,

16:22.950 --> 16:25.310
♪ It's not a coincidence or a miracle ♪

16:24.390 --> 16:26.440
it seems like he helped me through many,

16:25.840 --> 16:29.530
♪ It's destiny ♪

16:27.200 --> 16:28.480
many lonely days.

16:30.380 --> 16:32.230
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

16:32.250 --> 16:34.390
♪ Connecting you to my heartbeat ♪

16:34.450 --> 16:36.860
♪ Scrolling up and down the playlist ♪

16:36.790 --> 16:37.910
Mengmeng, I'm sorry.

16:36.890 --> 16:39.820
♪ Disrupting the rhythm of my breath ♪

16:37.910 --> 16:39.570
None of us got a ticket for you.

16:39.950 --> 16:41.900
♪ Listen to the same song on repeat ♪

16:40.200 --> 16:41.030
I'm sorry too.

16:41.030 --> 16:42.000
I messed it up, though I meant well.

16:41.930 --> 16:43.610
♪ Reveal the secret that should be kept ♪

16:42.670 --> 16:43.870
Why apologize at all?

16:43.690 --> 16:46.270
♪ The smile at the corner of your lips ♪

16:44.440 --> 16:45.270
Without you guys,

16:45.270 --> 16:46.550
I wouldn't have had fun.

16:46.290 --> 16:48.880
♪ Makes me wonder ♪

16:47.930 --> 16:49.320
We didn't get a ticket anyway.

16:49.180 --> 16:51.160
♪ Has Cupid ♪

16:49.440 --> 16:51.190
It's nice to sit here and listen.

16:51.190 --> 16:53.960
♪ Finally shot a golden arrow at you? ♪

16:57.010 --> 16:57.750
It's him!

16:57.910 --> 16:59.080
The man in a black hat!

16:59.080 --> 17:00.390
He sold me a fake ticket!

17:00.390 --> 17:01.150
You fraud!

17:01.150 --> 17:01.600
Stay!

17:01.600 --> 17:02.080
Freeze!

17:02.080 --> 17:02.720
Halt!

17:03.320 --> 17:04.680
You damn scammer!

17:04.680 --> 17:05.550
Stop there!

17:05.550 --> 17:06.609
Don't you run away!

17:11.960 --> 17:13.160
Stop running!

17:13.160 --> 17:13.920
Stop!

17:16.680 --> 17:17.550
His hat...

17:18.440 --> 17:19.310
The hat!

17:29.000 --> 17:29.860
Come down here!

17:32.070 --> 17:33.270
Put his pants back on!

17:37.750 --> 17:38.550
-Have you caught him?
-Run, I dare you.

17:38.550 --> 17:39.750
-Go get him!
-Come down here!

17:39.750 --> 17:40.880
Pants back on!

17:40.880 --> 17:42.310
-Come down here.
-Why stop running?

17:42.310 --> 17:43.070
Y-Y-You...

17:43.070 --> 17:43.790
give it back to me.

17:43.790 --> 17:44.590
Then come down here.

17:44.590 --> 17:46.120
And I'll give it back to you.

17:46.480 --> 17:47.270
You promise?

17:48.310 --> 17:49.570
Better keep your word.

17:54.960 --> 17:55.930
Please hear me out.

17:55.930 --> 17:57.720
The ticket I sold her was absolutely real.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.720
She just lost it,

17:58.720 --> 17:59.790
and somehow got a fake one.

17:59.790 --> 18:01.050
What is this nonsense?

18:01.050 --> 18:02.400
We traded in person.

18:02.400 --> 18:03.270
If you dare lie again,

18:03.270 --> 18:04.270
I'll beat you up!

18:06.620 --> 18:07.110
Look,

18:07.550 --> 18:09.310
I'm only running a small business.

18:09.310 --> 18:10.160
How about this?

18:10.160 --> 18:12.020
I have tickets to other concerts.

18:12.310 --> 18:12.840
I will...

18:13.070 --> 18:13.600
offer you

18:14.310 --> 18:15.070
a 90% discount for them,

18:15.070 --> 18:15.640
okay?

18:18.400 --> 18:19.110
A 90% discount?

18:19.110 --> 18:19.750
Denied!

18:19.880 --> 18:21.140
We want our money back!

18:24.550 --> 18:27.210
Seems like you've swindled
quite a lot of money.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.070
Don't...

18:31.480 --> 18:32.410
Don't hurt me...

18:32.590 --> 18:33.240
Well...

18:33.750 --> 18:35.310
L-Let's talk this out.

18:35.830 --> 18:37.270
Save your story

18:37.590 --> 18:38.720
for the police.

18:41.070 --> 18:42.000
Here's your hat.

18:42.310 --> 18:43.350
Thanks.

18:46.070 --> 18:46.590
Bye!

18:51.270 --> 18:52.240
Tong Xiaole!

18:54.240 --> 18:55.970
What exactly are you mad about?

19:22.850 --> 19:23.510
Lan,

19:23.510 --> 19:25.040
what's your target school?

19:26.640 --> 19:27.440
I've decided.

19:27.590 --> 19:28.830
I'll apply for a school of communications,

19:28.830 --> 19:30.110
so I can be my idol's agent

19:30.110 --> 19:31.840
and make him famous worldwide.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.410
I have faith in you.

19:37.750 --> 19:39.080
That's the next lesson.

19:40.730 --> 19:43.470
[Report Card for Grade 12 Monthly Exam]

20:08.790 --> 20:10.550
The highest score I've got.

20:09.370 --> 20:11.110
[Report Card for Grade 12 Monthly Exam]

20:11.030 --> 20:12.400
Who made it happen?

20:12.400 --> 20:14.310
You made it happen, Mr. Tong!

20:19.310 --> 20:20.110
Seriously?

20:20.240 --> 20:21.500
Are you still mad at me?

20:22.310 --> 20:23.400
But for what?

20:23.730 --> 20:24.350
Tell me.

20:24.550 --> 20:25.480
I'll apologize.

20:27.310 --> 20:28.170
Come on, say it.

20:29.720 --> 20:31.880
Are those paper cranes the reason?

20:33.210 --> 20:34.340
Or that love letter?

20:35.070 --> 20:36.510
-Love letter?
-Love letter?

20:36.510 --> 20:38.040
You wrote her a love letter?

20:38.070 --> 20:38.640
You did?

20:39.000 --> 20:39.880
And you gave it to her?

20:39.880 --> 20:41.310
What is this nonsense?

20:41.480 --> 20:42.750
Wrote who a love letter?

20:42.750 --> 20:43.310
Who?

20:43.720 --> 20:45.030
If you're asking

20:45.110 --> 20:46.550
about the girl he likes,

20:46.550 --> 20:48.350
then I think I know something...

20:48.550 --> 20:50.000
The girl he likes?

20:50.270 --> 20:51.590
Why didn't you tell me?

20:52.200 --> 20:52.930
Spill it now.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.590
This girl is right

20:55.590 --> 20:57.880
before our eyes.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.030
Me?

21:04.590 --> 21:05.270
You like me?

21:07.960 --> 21:08.440
Yes.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.000
I like you.

21:15.070 --> 21:15.960
Are you crazy?

21:17.590 --> 21:18.790
Don't flatter yourself.

21:18.790 --> 21:20.850
I'd have to be crazy to be into someone

21:22.240 --> 21:22.790
like you.

21:23.350 --> 21:24.240
Hey, Tong Xiaole,

21:24.240 --> 21:25.350
what do you mean?

21:26.430 --> 21:27.830
Now I'm the one being mad.

21:32.070 --> 21:33.270
To keep my anger at bay,

21:33.270 --> 21:35.530
you'd better tell me who you really like.

21:37.240 --> 21:38.790
He is into...

21:38.790 --> 21:40.240
Who?

21:41.880 --> 21:42.240
Me.

21:43.030 --> 21:43.400
Me.

21:44.310 --> 21:45.640
Quite a bustle here, huh?

21:45.640 --> 21:46.310
Xiaole.

21:46.960 --> 21:47.690
Come with me.

21:52.550 --> 21:53.680
What does this mean?

21:54.750 --> 21:56.150
Nobody told me the truth.

21:56.310 --> 21:57.040
Spill it now.

21:57.070 --> 21:58.270
We won't tell anyone.

21:59.550 --> 22:00.680
All I can tell you

22:00.790 --> 22:02.550
is that the answer is obvious,

22:02.830 --> 22:03.960
but cannot be told.

22:05.110 --> 22:06.590
Are we good friends or not?

22:07.550 --> 22:08.240
Xiaole.

22:08.880 --> 22:09.810
Have you decided

22:09.880 --> 22:11.070
which university...

22:11.070 --> 22:11.920
to apply for?

22:14.310 --> 22:15.710
Yes, Hailan University.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.980
Hailan University...

22:20.160 --> 22:21.560
Its computer science...

22:22.070 --> 22:24.720
and business management
are top-tier programs.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.070
Which major...

22:26.790 --> 22:27.720
will you choose?

22:29.310 --> 22:30.270
As for the major,

22:30.270 --> 22:30.720
I...

22:31.030 --> 22:32.400
haven't decided yet.

22:35.210 --> 22:36.010
Xiaole,

22:37.240 --> 22:38.160
I understand

22:38.790 --> 22:39.960
that your father

22:39.960 --> 22:41.490
is a bit too strict with you.

22:41.510 --> 22:42.270
That said,

22:43.240 --> 22:44.770
you should really listen to

22:45.400 --> 22:47.530
your inner voice when you pick a major.

22:48.030 --> 22:48.750
I mean,

22:48.750 --> 22:49.810
follow your heart.

22:50.070 --> 22:50.590
I'm saying that

22:50.590 --> 22:51.960
because with a major

22:51.960 --> 22:53.350
that you really like,

22:53.720 --> 22:56.120
at least you'll be happy
in your future life

22:56.830 --> 22:58.070
and studies.

22:58.880 --> 23:00.750
That's what I'd love to see.

23:01.880 --> 23:04.210
I heard from your fellows that you're into

23:04.270 --> 23:05.470
photography, right?

23:07.030 --> 23:08.890
It's actually quite a good major.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.270
If you're interested,

23:10.270 --> 23:11.790
I can introduce you to some...

23:11.790 --> 23:12.400
Bu,

23:13.270 --> 23:14.310
don't meddle with this.

23:14.310 --> 23:15.570
I'll take my leave now.

23:16.270 --> 23:17.600
Do give it some thought!

23:22.880 --> 23:23.550
What now?

23:23.830 --> 23:25.830
The principal pressured you again?

23:27.200 --> 23:27.830
The acceptance rate

23:27.830 --> 23:29.640
for key universities has decreased
in recent two years.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.770
Don't you know that?

23:31.720 --> 23:33.160
That boy Tong Xiaole from my class

23:33.160 --> 23:35.160
is a top ten student in the province.

23:35.350 --> 23:37.030
The principal's eyes are on him every day.

23:37.030 --> 23:38.630
How can I not feel pressured?

23:38.790 --> 23:39.720
Have you heard?

23:40.270 --> 23:41.160
The dean's office

23:41.160 --> 23:42.760
is discussing re-classing.

23:43.270 --> 23:46.070
I don't think you'll be able
to manage Xiaole soon.

23:54.380 --> 23:56.160
[Hailan University of China,
Undergraduate Admission]

23:56.190 --> 23:57.340
[Hailan University of China,
Undergraduate Admission]
[Photography Department]

24:08.000 --> 24:11.030
[You have a new message]

24:10.400 --> 24:12.030
Hello, sorry to bother you.

24:12.110 --> 24:14.160
I really like your photography style.

24:14.160 --> 24:15.270
Could you take a family photo

24:15.270 --> 24:16.740
of me and my grandmother?

24:17.000 --> 24:17.510
Can we meet up

24:17.510 --> 24:18.720
at your convenience?

24:21.400 --> 24:22.400
My grandmother

24:22.640 --> 24:24.400
has Alzheimer's.

24:24.640 --> 24:26.790
She's lucid sometimes,
but confused at others.

24:26.790 --> 24:28.070
She has long forgotten

24:28.070 --> 24:30.130
that my parents already passed away.

24:30.640 --> 24:33.040
She's even been mistaking me
for my mother.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.490
This is the whole story.

24:35.000 --> 24:36.160
So you're asking me

24:36.160 --> 24:38.070
to take a photo of your grandmother,

24:38.070 --> 24:39.480
which is similar to the one

24:39.480 --> 24:40.640
you just

24:41.110 --> 24:41.750
showed me?

24:42.350 --> 24:42.750
Yes.

24:46.110 --> 24:47.770
I've been working out of town.

24:47.830 --> 24:49.880
My childhood home
has been vacant for a long time.

24:49.880 --> 24:50.790
I'm going to stay here

24:50.790 --> 24:51.960
for about two weeks.

24:52.480 --> 24:53.240
Will you...

24:53.400 --> 24:54.310
take this job?

24:56.350 --> 24:59.150
You subscribed to my account
some time ago, right?

25:00.310 --> 25:01.160
I bet you are aware

25:01.160 --> 25:02.790
that I don't really like

25:02.790 --> 25:04.550
taking staged photos like that.

25:04.550 --> 25:05.480
Of course I know.

25:05.790 --> 25:08.250
Just take photos in whatever style
you like.

25:11.510 --> 25:13.110
Actually, I've been a bit busy

25:13.110 --> 25:14.510
w-w-with

25:14.510 --> 25:15.590
my studies lately.

25:16.030 --> 25:17.350
Why not hire someone else to...

25:17.350 --> 25:18.410
It's not a problem.

25:20.160 --> 25:22.020
We can work around your schedule.

25:22.310 --> 25:23.200
In fact,

25:24.310 --> 25:26.350
I've been your fan for quite some time.

25:26.350 --> 25:28.270
I didn't expect you to be so young.

25:28.830 --> 25:30.510
I really love the feeling

25:30.510 --> 25:32.110
that your photos convey,

25:33.350 --> 25:35.550
especially the one in your pinned post.

25:36.310 --> 25:37.710
Is that your girlfriend?

25:38.830 --> 25:39.350
No, no.

25:39.350 --> 25:40.160
She's not.

25:46.350 --> 25:47.270
How about this?

25:47.270 --> 25:49.000
Send me the photo,

25:49.480 --> 25:50.790
and I will...

25:51.110 --> 25:52.110
think about it.

25:52.310 --> 25:52.790
Okay.

25:52.870 --> 25:54.330
I'll wait to hear from you.

26:07.750 --> 26:09.080
What are you looking at?

26:19.070 --> 26:20.000
Come on.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.790
I bought you cake.

26:21.790 --> 26:22.960
Stop being mad, okay?

26:22.960 --> 26:24.160
I won't do that again.

26:27.510 --> 26:28.440
It was a mistake.

26:29.110 --> 26:29.960
What was the mistake?

26:29.960 --> 26:32.090
That I sent you someone's love letter.

26:34.070 --> 26:36.000
Have you ever had a crush on anyone?

26:36.270 --> 26:37.730
Are you looking down at me?

26:37.830 --> 26:38.590
So what if I've never

26:38.590 --> 26:39.790
had a crush on anyone?

26:41.750 --> 26:42.680
Why take it away?

26:45.720 --> 26:47.310
The girl who you just talked to

26:47.310 --> 26:48.720
seemed quite nice.

26:49.070 --> 26:51.670
Is she the girl
mentioned in your paper cranes?

26:51.830 --> 26:53.880
She is pretty, isn't she?

26:56.590 --> 26:58.790
How come you've never told me about her?

27:09.160 --> 27:10.030
Well...

27:10.790 --> 27:12.880
She's this madam's granddaughter.

27:12.880 --> 27:14.960
She just asked me to take a family photo

27:14.960 --> 27:17.070
of her and her grandmother like this one.

27:17.070 --> 27:17.790
Sounds lovely.

27:17.790 --> 27:18.850
When will you do it?

27:21.270 --> 27:22.510
I'm not sure if I'll do it.

27:22.510 --> 27:23.160
Why not?

27:24.270 --> 27:27.350
I think... an important photo like this

27:28.070 --> 27:29.070
should be taken

27:29.070 --> 27:30.800
by someone more professional.

27:31.480 --> 27:32.640
Have some confidence in yourself, alright?

27:32.640 --> 27:33.900
You take great photos.

27:44.000 --> 27:44.480
Hello?

27:44.830 --> 27:46.360
Hey, Xiaole, where are you?

27:46.920 --> 27:49.180
We're already downstairs at your place.

27:50.790 --> 27:51.640
So it means

27:52.160 --> 27:53.750
everyone in this family photo is gone,

27:53.750 --> 27:55.810
except Xiaorou and her grandmother?

27:55.960 --> 27:57.240
Her grandmother has no idea

27:57.240 --> 28:00.300
that her daughter and son-in-law
already passed away.

28:01.030 --> 28:02.270
That's so sad.

28:05.880 --> 28:07.440
We can do a role play.

28:07.830 --> 28:09.790
Perhaps it'll jog

28:09.790 --> 28:11.510
her grandmother's memory.

28:11.960 --> 28:13.020
That's a good idea!

28:13.400 --> 28:15.960
Xiaorou has indeed encountered
a harsh reality.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.400
But do we have time to help her?

28:17.400 --> 28:18.400
Exams are coming up,

28:18.400 --> 28:19.720
and our grades are terrible.

28:19.720 --> 28:20.550
If I fail again,

28:20.550 --> 28:21.950
my mom won't be nice to me.

28:21.960 --> 28:23.550
The time is pressing,

28:23.550 --> 28:24.400
but Xiaorou

28:24.400 --> 28:26.000
desperately needs our help.

28:26.720 --> 28:28.310
Plus, Xiaole is a great photographer.

28:28.310 --> 28:30.170
I'm sure he'd love to contribute.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.000
Stop trying to be a savior.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.460
Respect everyone's fate.

28:41.830 --> 28:43.360
This is Xiaole's business.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.110
Well...

28:47.590 --> 28:48.830
Will you help?

28:52.790 --> 28:55.480
I... am not sure.

28:56.400 --> 28:58.110
How about... we hold a vote?

28:58.640 --> 28:59.480
Wait a minute.

29:00.160 --> 29:02.070
This is my own business.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.160
Letting you vote on it

29:04.640 --> 29:07.070
makes me look utterly indecisive.

29:07.070 --> 29:08.600
You are really indecisive.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.880
But we're a team.

29:12.070 --> 29:13.510
Yes, we are a team.

29:13.510 --> 29:15.240
Your business is our business.

29:15.240 --> 29:17.350
Don't stand on ceremony, lad.

29:18.270 --> 29:19.160
Hello!

29:20.240 --> 29:22.240
-Zhao Zhenghao?
-You all missed me a lot, didn't you?

29:22.240 --> 29:23.070
You came at the perfect time.

29:23.070 --> 29:24.400
Let me ask you something.

29:24.400 --> 29:25.640
We'd like to help a stranger

29:25.640 --> 29:26.640
fulfill her wish.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.550
Are you for or against it?

29:29.960 --> 29:31.070
Say what now?

29:32.960 --> 29:33.880
Give me an answer.

29:33.880 --> 29:34.790
That sounds fun.

29:34.790 --> 29:35.880
Okay, three to two. We win.

29:35.880 --> 29:36.790
What "three to two"?

29:36.790 --> 29:38.850
Zhao Zhenghao's vote doesn't count.

29:39.000 --> 29:39.960
He has joined us

29:39.960 --> 29:40.750
in so many events.

29:40.750 --> 29:42.640
-Do you still not see him one of us?
-Wait.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.570
What do you mean?

29:43.960 --> 29:45.640
Have I never been taken seriously?

29:45.640 --> 29:46.310
Fine, I'm leaving then.

29:46.310 --> 29:48.070
You're of course
an important member of ours.

29:48.070 --> 29:49.470
Your vote surely counts.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.880
Tong Xiaole's vote is also valid.

29:51.880 --> 29:53.070
As the person involved,

29:53.070 --> 29:54.110
he doesn't get to vote.

29:54.110 --> 29:55.590
It's a tie, three to three.

29:55.590 --> 29:56.790
Though he appears reluctant,

29:56.790 --> 29:57.640
he actually wants to do it.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.790
He just hates for us to interfere.

29:58.790 --> 29:59.640
Enough!

29:59.830 --> 30:00.790
Wait. What's going on?

30:00.790 --> 30:01.750
Quiet down.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.270
This discussion has nothing

30:03.270 --> 30:05.070
to do with the one we had earlier.

30:05.350 --> 30:06.400
Don't waste time.

30:10.550 --> 30:11.410
How about this?

30:12.000 --> 30:12.600
I'll do it.

30:13.640 --> 30:14.480
Listen,

30:14.750 --> 30:16.400
next Friday after school,

30:16.550 --> 30:18.080
come join me if you're free.

30:18.550 --> 30:20.160
Now, all of you are

30:20.590 --> 30:21.520
satisfied, huh?

30:25.400 --> 30:26.260
What happened?

30:27.790 --> 30:28.720
Care to explain?

30:29.960 --> 30:31.260
[Class 9, Grade 12]

30:59.030 --> 31:00.160
It's so dark in here.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.790
Dusty, too.

31:02.790 --> 31:04.070
So much dust around.

31:12.830 --> 31:14.360
How long until they arrive?

31:14.720 --> 31:15.510
Let me check.

31:17.550 --> 31:19.610
Xiaorou said it'd take one more hour.

31:19.750 --> 31:20.750
We need to restore this place

31:20.750 --> 31:22.310
to how it used to look, right?

31:22.310 --> 31:22.750
Yeah.

31:23.030 --> 31:24.790
Then... let's get to work.

31:25.270 --> 31:25.790
Okay.

31:36.070 --> 31:38.160
It looks quite decent!

31:38.400 --> 31:39.730
What do you think, guys?

31:39.790 --> 31:40.720
You look good.

31:40.720 --> 31:41.520
Just alright.

31:41.830 --> 31:43.830
The only similarity is your outfit.

31:44.160 --> 31:44.830
It's fine.

31:44.830 --> 31:46.310
If that old lady mistakes Xiaorou
for her daughter,

31:46.310 --> 31:48.770
then she'll probably mistake me
for her son.

31:49.590 --> 31:50.270
Chen Fan.

31:51.960 --> 31:53.560
You look quite like the part.

31:53.790 --> 31:54.960
Why did you bring me

31:54.960 --> 31:56.310
to the old house?

31:58.030 --> 31:59.830
Why are there so many people?

32:01.270 --> 32:02.590
This is the photographer I hired.

32:02.590 --> 32:03.070
He will

32:03.070 --> 32:04.130
take photos for us.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.040
Hello, ma'am.

32:06.790 --> 32:08.190
Why are you all standing?

32:08.310 --> 32:09.020
Have a seat.

32:09.040 --> 32:10.030
Be seated.

32:10.110 --> 32:10.640
Sit down.

32:10.720 --> 32:11.070
Okay.

32:12.110 --> 32:13.550
This is my son's outfit.

32:14.160 --> 32:16.160
Why are you wearing my son's outfit?

32:16.160 --> 32:17.550
He's wearing my son's outfit!

32:17.550 --> 32:19.240
I am your son's colleague.

32:19.310 --> 32:20.910
I have the same outfit as him.

32:22.070 --> 32:23.480
He said he missed you a lot,

32:23.480 --> 32:24.510
so he sent us here in particular

32:24.510 --> 32:25.400
to take a photo of you.

32:25.400 --> 32:26.860
He'd love to see your face.

32:27.510 --> 32:28.240
What...

32:28.510 --> 32:29.590
What did you say?

32:30.000 --> 32:31.790
My son missed me?

32:31.790 --> 32:32.920
-Yes, a lot.
-Right.

32:33.480 --> 32:33.740
Yes.

32:33.750 --> 32:35.590
My son missed me...

32:36.160 --> 32:36.560
Hurry.

32:36.590 --> 32:37.350
-Ma'am...
-Hurry!

32:37.350 --> 32:38.550
Take a photo of me!

32:38.570 --> 32:40.160
-Take a photo of me now!
-Ma'am, stand here.

32:40.160 --> 32:40.640
Well,

32:40.640 --> 32:41.640
do I look fine?

32:41.640 --> 32:42.510
Is my outfit okay?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.350
-You look great!
-You look great!

32:43.350 --> 32:44.160
Really?

32:44.640 --> 32:45.640
Look here, ma'am.

32:45.790 --> 32:46.830
Three, two, one.

32:49.760 --> 32:51.450
Thank you so much.

32:51.480 --> 32:53.070
Grandma passed away peacefully.

32:53.070 --> 32:53.640
Really,

32:53.960 --> 32:55.790
thank you for breaking your rule

32:55.920 --> 32:58.450
and taking this last photo
of my grandmother.

33:00.000 --> 33:00.830
Xiaole!

33:01.400 --> 33:02.310
Xiaole!

33:02.830 --> 33:03.400
Dad.

33:03.590 --> 33:04.190
Come here.

33:04.750 --> 33:06.240
Mom and Dad are back.

33:07.000 --> 33:07.880
Did you miss us?

33:08.310 --> 33:08.720
Yes.

33:08.790 --> 33:10.030
Look what I bought you.

33:10.030 --> 33:11.480
A camera!

33:11.720 --> 33:13.160
Take photos with it from now on, okay?

33:13.160 --> 33:13.550
Okay.

33:13.550 --> 33:14.480
Let's try it out.

33:14.550 --> 33:14.960
Sure.

33:16.830 --> 33:17.790
Alright. One, two, three.

33:17.790 --> 33:18.550
Up you go!

33:18.550 --> 33:19.350
Up you go!

33:20.070 --> 33:21.110
Let me get you up!

33:21.510 --> 33:22.310
Xiaole,

33:22.640 --> 33:23.790
what fish is this?

33:24.310 --> 33:25.480
Catfish.

33:25.480 --> 33:26.270
Yes, catfish.

33:26.270 --> 33:27.350
Come over here.

33:27.350 --> 33:28.510
What fish is this?

33:28.510 --> 33:29.550
Grass carp.

33:31.310 --> 33:32.400
What is this then?

33:32.640 --> 33:34.550
Purple-spotted tonguefish.

33:34.650 --> 33:35.450
[Purple-spotted Tonguefish]

33:36.110 --> 33:36.790
Impressive.

33:36.790 --> 33:39.310
Xiaole, what fish do you like to eat?

33:39.360 --> 33:42.260
[Purple-spotted Tonguefish]

33:39.880 --> 33:41.000
Sharks.

33:46.000 --> 33:46.750
Xiaole,

33:47.110 --> 33:49.170
how about you like eating grass crap?

34:02.860 --> 34:07.400
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

34:20.000 --> 34:20.800
Mom,

34:21.290 --> 34:22.730
have you had dinner yet?
